{%- comment -%}e-Stegplatten (global): WhatsApp-Links bekommen das Original-WhatsApp-Icon, Telefon-Links in Beratungs-Boxen ein Hörer-Icon. Beratungs-Buttons (.es-cta) gleich groß: 2 Buttons = 2 gleiche Spalten, 3 Buttons = 3 Spalten (mobil: 2 + 1 volle Breite).{%- endcomment -%}
<style id="es-wa">
html body .es-wa-i:not(#_){width:18px;height:18px;flex:none;display:inline-block;vertical-align:-3px;fill:currentColor}
html body .es-cta:not(#_){display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(0,1fr))!important;grid-auto-flow:column;gap:8px!important;width:100%}
html body .es-cta > a:not(#_){grid-column:auto!important;display:flex!important;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:48px!important;min-height:48px;padding:0 12px!important;margin:0!important;font-size:15px!important;font-weight:700!important;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none!important;width:auto!important;flex:none!important}
html body .es-cta > a[href*="wa.me"]:not(#_){background:#25D366!important;color:#fff!important}
@media(max-width:749px){
html body .es-cta:not(#_){grid-auto-flow:row;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr!important}
html body .es-cta > a:nth-child(3):last-child:not(#_){grid-column:1/-1!important}
html body .es-cta > a:not(#_){font-size:14.5px!important;padding:0 8px!important}
}
</style>
